# Who must approve changes to the parts of this repository that control deployment, access to production, money, and the database.
# Teammates can change everything else on `staging` with a normal reviewed PR. Branch protection on `staging` has "Require review from Code
# Owners" turned on, so a PR touching any path below cannot merge without the owner's approval.
#
# Why: the GitHub "staging" environment holds a Cloudflare token that can edit Workers in the whole account. Anything that decides what runs with
# it (workflows, deploy scripts, Wrangler configs) is therefore a route to production, and must be reviewed by the owner.

